#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "Gravity Forms - Missing Extension Notice"
msgstr "Gravity Forms - Missing Extension Notice"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "https://github.com/guilamu/gf-missing-extensions-notice"
msgstr "https://github.com/guilamu/gf-missing-extensions-notice"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid "Warns the admin when a Gravity Forms form requires a missing extension (GF add-on, Gravity Perks, or other). Combines a scan of the form JSON and a scan of the feeds."
msgstr "Avertit l'admin lorsqu'un formulaire Gravity Forms requiert une extension (add-on GF, Gravity Perks, ou autre) manquante. Combine un scan du JSON du formulaire et un scan des feeds."

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "Guillaume"
msgstr "Guillaume"

